---
layout: base.njk
title: Notes
navSection: notes
permalink: notes/index.html
---
<section class="subpage-hero">
        <div class="eyebrow">Notes · A growing collection</div>
        <h1>Things I learn, <em>written down.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">A place for concepts, worked examples, and explanations I want to come back to. These notes will grow as I study and make connections between ideas.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="topics-title">
        <h2 id="topics-title">Topics</h2>
        <div class="content-grid">
          {% for category in noteTopics %}<article class="content-card">
            <span class="content-tag">0{{ loop.index }} · {{ category.name }}</span>
            <h3><a href="/notes/{{ category.slug }}/">{{ category.headline }}</a></h3>
            <p>{{ category.description }}</p>
            <div class="project-links"><a href="/notes/{{ category.slug }}/">Browse {{ category.name }} →</a></div>
          </article>{% endfor %}
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="latest-title">
        <h2 id="latest-title">Latest notes</h2>
        {% if collections.notes.length %}<div class="project-list">{% for note in collections.notes %}<article class="project-row"><div><div class="eyebrow-small">{{ note.data.topic or "Learning" }} · {{ note.date | dateLabel }}</div><h3><a href="{{ note.url }}">{{ note.data.title }}</a></h3><p>{{ note.data.summary }}</p><div class="project-links"><a href="{{ note.url }}">Read note ↗</a></div></div></article>{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<div class="solution-empty"><div class="eyebrow-small">The collection starts here</div><p>No notes published yet. I’ll add entries as I turn what I learn into explanations and examples.</p></div>{% endif %}
        <p>Looking for programming problem write-ups? Visit <a class="text-link" href="../online-judge/index.html">Online Judge ↗</a>.</p>
      </section>
      <p><a class="back-link" href="../index.html">← Back to the home page</a></p>
